1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,155
一段录音从左边送进来
A voice recording goes in on the left.

2
00:00:02,475 --> 00:00:05,072
五个程序，各自在自己的 container 里
Five programs, each in its own container,

3
00:00:05,072 --> 00:00:10,837
把它变成英文和法文的播客，彼此之间从不发一条消息
turn it into a podcast in English and in French, without ever sending each other a message.

4
00:00:11,157 --> 00:00:13,547
那它们是怎么配合的，又是谁来付钱？
So how do they cooperate, and who pays?

5
00:00:13,783 --> 00:00:17,846
和上节课比，有四处变化：你要自己写 Dockerfile
Since last lecture, four things change: you write the Dockerfile,

6
00:00:17,846 --> 00:00:20,034
而且要构建五个 image，而不是一个
and you build five images, not one.

7
00:00:20,354 --> 00:00:23,183
一个 bind mount 会打开一扇通往你笔记本的窗
A bind mount opens a window into your laptop,

8
00:00:23,183 --> 00:00:25,509
container 则连到 Google Cloud
and the containers reach Google Cloud

9
00:00:25,509 --> 00:00:28,653
靠的是共享的 bucket 和服务账号密钥
through a shared bucket and a service account key.

10
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,143
把 mega-pipeline 的 README 打开，放在视频旁边
Open the mega-pipeline README beside this video.

11
00:00:32,463 --> 00:00:36,549
左上角的进度条把 README 分成一个个编号的步骤
The tracker, top left, splits the README into numbered steps;

12
00:00:36,549 --> 00:00:39,161
代码面板会标出文件和行号
code panels show file and line numbers.

13
00:00:39,481 --> 00:00:41,845
看到黄色的 your turn 标签就暂停
Pause at the yellow your-turn tag;

14
00:00:41,845 --> 00:00:45,391
灰色的 extra 标签表示这条命令 README 里没有
a gray extra tag marks a command not in the README.

15
00:00:45,633 --> 00:00:48,833
你需要先做完 Tutorial 0，装好 Docker Desktop 和 uv
You'll need Tutorial 0, for Docker Desktop and uv,

16
00:00:48,833 --> 00:00:51,905
还要有从 Canvas 下载的课程密钥和你们组的组名
the course key from Canvas, and your group name.

17
00:00:52,225 --> 00:00:56,364
每条命令也都在学习指南里，链接在视频简介里
Every command is also in the study guide, linked in the description.

18
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,666
有一点先说清楚：我们录制时没有课程密钥
One honest limit: we recorded without a course key,

19
00:00:59,666 --> 00:01:01,890
所以凡是代码要和 Google 打交道的地方
so wherever the code talks to Google,

20
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:05,496
你看到的是命令和该看什么，而不是它的输出
you'll see the command and what to look for, not its output.

21
00:01:05,733 --> 00:01:09,456
我们录制时用的是一台 Debian 12 笔记本
We recorded on a Debian 12 laptop with Docker Engine 29, at the time of recording.

22
00:01:09,456 --> 00:01:11,749
装着 Docker Engine 29
We recorded on a Debian 12 laptop with Docker Engine 29, at the time of recording.

23
00:01:12,069 --> 00:01:13,569
在 Mac 或 Windows 上
On a Mac or Windows,

24
00:01:13,569 --> 00:01:17,141
提示符不一样，由 Docker Desktop 来跑 container
the prompt differs and Docker Desktop runs the containers;

25
00:01:17,141 --> 00:01:18,832
命令都是一样的
the commands are the same.

26
00:01:19,867 --> 00:01:23,110
在生产环境里，服务之间会互相调 API
In production, services call each other's APIs.

27
00:01:23,430 --> 00:01:25,019
这个教程做了简化
This tutorial simplifies:

28
00:01:25,019 --> 00:01:30,107
每个组件把输出写进共享存储，下一个组件再从那里读
each component writes its output to shared storage, where the next one reads it.

29
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:33,579
这个共享存储就是一个 Google Cloud Storage 的 bucket
That storage is one Google Cloud Storage bucket,

30
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,598
画成一个带抽屉的柜子
drawn as a cabinet of drawers.

31
00:01:35,918 --> 00:01:40,370
第一个阶段 A，把 input audios 里的录音转写成文字
The first stage, A, turns recordings from input audios into transcripts

32
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:41,970
放进 text prompts
in text prompts.

33
00:01:42,190 --> 00:01:45,874
然后 B 把每份转写文本写成更长的播客稿
Then B turns each transcript into a longer podcast script,

34
00:01:45,874 --> 00:01:47,474
放进 text paragraphs
in text paragraphs.

35
00:01:47,617 --> 00:01:49,217
从这里开始，路分成了两条
From there the path splits.

36
00:01:49,452 --> 00:01:54,444
C 把播客稿变成英文语音，存进名叫 text audios 的抽屉
C turns the script into English speech, stored in the drawer named text audios.

37
00:01:54,764 --> 00:01:57,938
D 把它翻译成法语，放进 text translated
D translates it into French, in text translated,

38
00:01:57,938 --> 00:02:00,716
E 再把法语念出来，放进 output audios
and E speaks the French, in output audios.

39
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,502
没有谁会触发谁：每个组件都由你自己按这个顺序来跑
Nothing triggers anything: you run each component yourself, in this order.

40
00:02:05,784 --> 00:02:08,715
一个 bucket 里并没有真正的目录
A bucket has no real folders: a name like text_prompts/group-01/input-….txt is one single object name.

41
00:02:08,715 --> 00:02:12,307
前缀 text prompts，加上组名 group-01
A bucket has no real folders: a name like text_prompts/group-01/input-….txt is one single object name.

42
00:02:12,307 --> 00:02:17,026
再加上 input- 开头的文件名，这一整串只是一个对象名
A bucket has no real folders: a name like text_prompts/group-01/input-….txt is one single object name.

43
00:02:17,267 --> 00:02:21,021
这是 A 的上传代码：前缀、组名、文件名
Here's A's upload code: prefix, group name, file name,

44
00:02:21,021 --> 00:02:23,454
而且只传 input 开头的文件
and only files starting with input.

45
00:02:23,774 --> 00:02:28,766
B 用同样的模式下载：这条命名约定，就是全部的连线
B downloads with the same pattern: that naming contract is the whole wiring.

46
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,983
组名把各组分开，但它的默认值没有任何保护
The group name keeps teams apart, and its default has no guard:

47
00:02:32,983 --> 00:02:39,432
忘了改的组件会写进默认组的抽屉，可能还会覆盖别人的成果
a component you forgot to edit writes into the default group's drawer, maybe over someone else's work.

48
00:02:39,752 --> 00:02:41,352
每次运行之前都要把它设好
Set it before every run.

49
00:02:41,534 --> 00:02:45,310
每个阶段成功了，实时排行榜上你那一行就会亮起来
Each stage that succeeds lights up your row on a live leaderboard.

50
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:50,088
每次调用、每个字节，都记在课程项目的账上，不是你的
Every call and every byte is billed to the course's project, not yours.

51
00:02:50,334 --> 00:02:54,387
哪两个阶段可以同时跑，哪一个又必须等？
Which two stages could run at the same time, and which one has to wait?

52
00:03:03,234 --> 00:03:08,482
C 和 D 都只读 B 写的 text paragraphs，所以它们可以并行跑
C and D both read only B's text paragraphs, so they could run side by side.

53
00:03:08,802 --> 00:03:11,554
E 读的是 D 写的东西，所以它要等 D
E reads what D writes, so it waits for D.

54
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,416
README 的第一条命令：把 repo clone 下来
The README's first command: clone the repo.

55
00:03:15,736 --> 00:03:18,826
输入 git clone，加上从 README 复制来的地址
Type git clone and the address, copied from the README,

56
00:03:18,826 --> 00:03:20,426
然后暂停，自己跑一遍
and pause to run it.

57
00:03:20,483 --> 00:03:22,254
然后 cd mega-pipeline
Then cd mega-pipeline.

58
00:03:22,574 --> 00:03:24,845
一个额外检查，README 里没有
An extra check, not in the README,

59
00:03:24,845 --> 00:03:28,919
列出文件，再显示 commit，可以看到五个组件目录
lists the files and shows the commit: five component folders,

60
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:32,259
在 main 分支上，正是这个视频用的 commit
on the main branch, at the commit this video uses.

61
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,889
再加一个额外检查，列出全部五个目录
Another extra lists all five folders.

62
00:03:35,209 --> 00:03:39,289
每个目录都有 README、自己的 cli.py 和 secrets 目录
Each has a README, its own cli.py, and a secrets folder,

63
00:03:39,289 --> 00:03:44,681
却没有一个有 Dockerfile：README 里说，五个都要你自己写
and not one has a Dockerfile: the README says you write all five yourself.

64
00:03:44,917 --> 00:03:46,560
有两处不同要记住
Two differences to remember.

65
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:51,717
一是 generate text 目录已经有自己的 pyproject.toml
The generate text folder already has its own pyproject.toml

66
00:03:51,717 --> 00:03:55,242
还有一个 main.py 文件，但没有 .gitignore 文件
and a main.py file, but no .gitignore file.

67
00:03:55,562 --> 00:03:58,037
二是 synthesis audio 目录里有个附加脚本
And synthesis audio has a bonus script.

68
00:03:58,283 --> 00:03:59,883
现在来看第一个组件
Now the first component.

69
00:04:00,182 --> 00:04:03,430
打开 transcribe audio 目录里的 README
Open the README in the transcribe audio folder:

70
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:07,990
进度条切换到它，它的第 1 步是 cd 进这个目录
the tracker switches to it, and its step 1 is cd transcribe_audio.

71
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:10,017
暂停一下，跟上进度
Pause, and catch up to here.

72
00:04:10,267 --> 00:04:12,614
在编辑器里打开 cli.py
Open cli.py in your editor.

73
00:04:12,934 --> 00:04:15,297
前几个 import 是 Python 自带的
The first imports come with Python,

74
00:04:15,297 --> 00:04:18,672
但两个 Google Cloud 模块和 ffmpeg 不是
but the two Google Cloud modules and ffmpeg don't.

75
00:04:18,992 --> 00:04:20,891
第二部分会讲它们从哪儿来
Part 2 shows where they come from.

76
00:04:21,133 --> 00:04:26,081
接下来是四个设置：bucket 的名字、这个阶段用的两个抽屉
Next come four settings: the bucket's name, the two drawers this stage uses,

77
00:04:26,081 --> 00:04:31,160
还有第 21 行的组名，现在还是默认值，你很快就要改它
and on line 21 the group name, still at its default, which you'll change soon.

78
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:34,260
在最下面，main 最多执行三个动作
At the bottom, main runs up to three verbs,

79
00:04:34,260 --> 00:04:37,651
顺序永远是：下载、转写、上传
always in this order: download, transcribe, upload.

80
00:04:39,633 --> 00:04:42,728
第 2 步是密钥：从 Canvas 下载的一个文件
Step 2 is the key: a file from Canvas

81
00:04:42,728 --> 00:04:44,902
叫 mega-pipeline.json
called mega-pipeline.json.

82
00:04:45,222 --> 00:04:48,689
有了它，你的代码就能以课程的服务账号的身份行事
It lets your code act as the course's service account,

83
00:04:48,689 --> 00:04:52,220
那是一个机器人 Google 账号，所以要像保管信用卡一样保管它
a robot Google account, so guard it like a credit card.

84
00:04:52,466 --> 00:04:56,299
暂停一下，把它下载下来，放进这个目录下的 secrets 目录
Pause, download it, and put it in this folder's secrets folder,

85
00:04:56,299 --> 00:04:58,610
另外四个目录也各放一份
with a copy in each of the other four.

86
00:04:59,716 --> 00:05:01,316
文件名必须一字不差
The name must be exact.

87
00:05:01,551 --> 00:05:05,306
如果你的浏览器保存时给它加了一个带括号的 1，就重命名一下
If your browser saved it with a 1 in parentheses, rename it.

88
00:05:05,866 --> 00:05:10,381
一个小错误：各组件的 README 链接的是一个旧的 Canvas 文件
A small mistake: the component READMEs link to an older Canvas file,

89
00:05:10,381 --> 00:05:12,373
所以用主 README 的链接
so use the main README's link.

90
00:05:12,616 --> 00:05:14,323
第 3 步用的是 uv
Step 3 uses uv.

91
00:05:14,643 --> 00:05:16,143
做完 Tutorial 0 的话
After Tutorial 0,

92
00:05:16,143 --> 00:05:20,893
uv --version 会打印出一个版本号，那就直接跳到 uv init
uv --version prints a version, so skip ahead to uv init.

93
00:05:21,213 --> 00:05:24,840
我们录制用的这台笔记本没装 uv：报 command not found
This recording laptop had no uv: command not found.

94
00:05:25,083 --> 00:05:30,065
否则就用 README 里的安装脚本：在 macOS 或 Linux 上
Otherwise, use the README's installer: on macOS or Linux,

95
00:05:30,065 --> 00:05:35,920
用这行 curl 命令，录制时它装的是 uv 0.13.0
this curl line, which installed uv 0.13.0 at the time of recording.

96
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,453
在 Windows 上，用 PowerShell 那一行
On Windows, the PowerShell line;

97
00:05:38,453 --> 00:05:40,528
任何系统都能用：pip install uv
on any system, pip install uv.

98
00:05:40,766 --> 00:05:44,266
然后重启终端，正如安装脚本所说
Then restart your terminal, as the installer says,

99
00:05:44,266 --> 00:05:47,486
再 cd 回 transcribe audio 目录，uv 就有回应了
cd back into transcribe audio, and uv answers.

100
00:05:47,933 --> 00:05:51,261
现在是这一步本身：uv init --bare
Now the step itself: uv init --bare.

101
00:05:51,581 --> 00:05:54,862
它只写一个文件，pyproject.toml
It writes just one file, pyproject.toml,

102
00:05:54,862 --> 00:05:57,896
项目名叫 transcribe-audio
for a project named transcribe-audio.

103
00:05:58,216 --> 00:05:59,566
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

104
00:05:59,616 --> 00:06:05,240
额外看一眼里面的内容：一个名字、一个版本号、一个空的依赖列表
An extra look inside: a name, a version, an empty list of dependencies,

105
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:08,171
还有最低 Python 版本 3.11
and the minimum Python version, 3.11.

106
00:06:08,416 --> 00:06:13,600
这个 3.11 来自这台笔记本上的 Python，3.11.2
That 3.11 comes from this laptop's Python, 3.11.2.

107
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:17,748
在 image 里，uv sync 需要一个落在这个范围内的 Python
In the image, uv sync needs a Python in this range,

108
00:06:17,748 --> 00:06:20,299
3.12 正好在里面，所以没问题
and 3.12 is in it, so all is well.

109
00:06:20,533 --> 00:06:22,666
你看到的数字取决于你的笔记本
Your number depends on your laptop.

110
00:06:22,986 --> 00:06:25,708
如果你的是 3.13 及以上
If yours says 3.13 or newer,

111
00:06:25,708 --> 00:06:30,666
image 里的 3.12 就落在范围之外，那就把它改成 3.12
the image's 3.12 falls outside, so edit it to 3.12.

112
00:06:30,986 --> 00:06:32,475
这个改法 README 里没有
That fix isn't in the README;

113
00:06:32,475 --> 00:06:34,614
到了 generate text 组件你就知道为什么
generate text shows why.

114
00:06:35,883 --> 00:06:39,836
第 4 步是这节课的核心：这里没有 Dockerfile
Step 4 is the heart of this lecture: there's no Dockerfile here,

115
00:06:39,836 --> 00:06:42,368
所以你要自己写，一块一块地拼起来
so you write it yourself, piece by piece.

116
00:06:42,616 --> 00:06:47,885
第 1 行从 Debian 12 上的官方 Python 3.12 image 开始
Line 1 starts from the official Python 3.12 image on Debian 12.

117
00:06:48,205 --> 00:06:51,384
README 是在正文里提到它的，而不是在代码块里
The README names it in its text, not in a code block.

118
00:06:51,633 --> 00:06:57,492
第 3 行声明了一个构建参数，一个只在构建期间存在的变量
Line 3 declares a build argument, a variable that exists only during the build:

119
00:06:57,492 --> 00:07:00,977
Debian 软件包 build-essential 和 ffmpeg
the Debian packages build-essential and ffmpeg.

120
00:07:01,297 --> 00:07:07,036
而 Python 包 ffmpeg-python 只是用来运行 ffmpeg 程序
The Python package ffmpeg-python just runs the ffmpeg program.

121
00:07:07,283 --> 00:07:10,846
第 5 到 10 行设置了六个环境变量
Lines 5 to 10 set six environment variables.

122
00:07:11,166 --> 00:07:15,582
和第 2 讲一样，它们只写在配置卡片上：不产生层
As in lecture 2, they only write on the config card: no layers.

123
00:07:15,902 --> 00:07:19,980
前四个是：apt 从不提问，文本用 Unicode
The first four: apt never asks questions, text is Unicode,

124
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:24,691
Python 立刻输出，uv 复制文件而不是建链接
Python prints at once, and uv copies files instead of linking them.

125
00:07:24,933 --> 00:07:26,928
第 9 行最要紧
Line 9 matters most:

126
00:07:26,928 --> 00:07:33,210
它告诉 uv，venv 要建在 /home/app/.venv，在 /app 外面
it tells uv to build the venv in /home/app/.venv, outside /app.

127
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:35,152
很快，这一行就会救我们一命
Soon, this line saves us.

128
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:39,724
第 10 行告诉 Google 的库，密钥在哪里
Line 10 tells Google's libraries where the key is:

129
00:07:39,724 --> 00:07:43,528
secrets/mega-pipeline.json，一个相对路径
secrets/mega-pipeline.json, a relative path.

130
00:07:43,766 --> 00:07:47,115
第 12 到 21 行是一条 RUN 指令
Lines 12 to 21 are one RUN instruction.

131
00:07:47,435 --> 00:07:51,864
除了最后一行，每行都以反斜杠结尾，让指令接着往下写
Every line but the last ends in a backslash, which continues it,

132
00:07:51,864 --> 00:07:55,393
&& 把各条命令串起来，所以只产生一层
and && chains the commands, so they make one layer.

133
00:07:55,713 --> 00:07:58,315
它更新 Debian，装上我们要的软件包
It updates Debian, installs our packages,

134
00:07:58,315 --> 00:08:03,073
再在同一层里删掉 apt 的软件包列表，所以它们不占空间
and deletes the apt package lists in that same layer, so they cost nothing.

135
00:08:03,316 --> 00:08:06,153
然后它升级 pip，再用 pip 装上 uv
Then it upgrades pip and installs uv with it.

136
00:08:06,473 --> 00:08:09,385
和第 1 讲里 Debian 的系统 Python 不同
Unlike Debian's system Python in lecture 1,

137
00:08:09,385 --> 00:08:13,514
这个 Python 属于 image，所以 pip 可以往里装
this Python belongs to the image, so pip may install into it.

138
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:17,730
最后，它创建一个叫 app 的用户，用户 ID 1000
Last, it creates a user called app, user ID 1000,

139
00:08:17,730 --> 00:08:23,414
拥有 /app：README 里说，用 root 运行有安全风险
who owns /app: as the README says, running as root is a security risk.

140
00:08:23,650 --> 00:08:29,154
第 23 和 24 行切换到这个用户，并把 /app 设成工作目录
Lines 23 and 24 switch to that user and make /app the working folder.

141
00:08:29,474 --> 00:08:35,660
第 26 行把这个目录里的一切都复制进 image；记住这个词：一切
Line 26 copies everything in this folder into the image; hold on to that word, everything.

142
00:08:35,900 --> 00:08:40,992
第 27 行运行 uv sync，按 pyproject.toml 建好 venv
Line 27 runs uv sync to build the venv from pyproject.toml,

143
00:08:40,992 --> 00:08:47,206
第 29 和 30 行启动 bash，并激活 venv，和第 2 讲一样
and lines 29 and 30 start bash with the venv activated, as in lecture 2.

144
00:08:50,733 --> 00:08:54,392
主 README 的 Appendix 部分有个示例 Dockerfile
The main README's appendix has a sample Dockerfile,

145
00:08:54,392 --> 00:08:57,978
但它的构建参数是 curl 而不是 ffmpeg
but its build argument has curl instead of ffmpeg:

146
00:08:57,978 --> 00:09:00,632
别把它贴进 transcribe audio 组件
don't paste it into transcribe audio.

147
00:09:00,866 --> 00:09:02,487
现在暂停，把它写出来
Pause now and write it:

148
00:09:02,487 --> 00:09:05,517
一个名叫 Dockerfile、没有扩展名的文件
a file named Dockerfile, with no extension.

149
00:09:05,837 --> 00:09:10,875
先敲 FROM 那一行，再把 README 的六个代码块按顺序复制到下面
Type the FROM line, then copy the README's six code blocks below it, in order,

150
00:09:10,875 --> 00:09:15,266
块与块之间空一行，这样你的行号就和我们的一致
with one blank line between blocks, so your line numbers match ours.

151
00:09:16,050 --> 00:09:19,101
先额外检查一下：你的 Dockerfile
First, an extra check: your Dockerfile,

152
00:09:19,101 --> 00:09:22,855
名字一字不差，就在 pyproject.toml 旁边
named exactly that, sits next to pyproject.toml.

153
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:26,086
第 5 步构建 image。一个小缺口
Step 5 builds the image. A small gap:

154
00:09:26,086 --> 00:09:30,033
README 给了 image 的名字 transcribe audio，却没给命令
the README names it, transcribe audio, but gives no command.

155
00:09:30,353 --> 00:09:33,191
命令是这样的：docker build，加上 -t 和 image 名
Here it is: docker build -t transcribe_audio,

156
00:09:33,191 --> 00:09:36,092
然后是一个点，代表这个目录，也就是构建上下文
then a dot for this folder, the build context.

157
00:09:36,333 --> 00:09:37,755
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

158
00:09:37,805 --> 00:09:40,152
你的终端显示的是精简的实时视图
Your terminal shows a compact live view

159
00:09:40,152 --> 00:09:43,522
每个构建步骤跑完后都会折叠成一行
that folds each build step into one line when it's done.

160
00:09:43,842 --> 00:09:46,470
这里是完整日志里的几处关键行
Here are the full log's landmarks;

161
00:09:46,470 --> 00:09:49,794
想自己看到它们，就加上右上角灰字里的那个参数
to see them yourself, add --progress=plain.

162
00:09:50,114 --> 00:09:55,981
构建步骤 2 是我们那个大 RUN：apt 装了 237 个软件包
Build step 2 is our big RUN: apt installs 237 packages,

163
00:09:55,981 --> 00:10:03,128
下载了 205 MB，然后 pip 装好 uv，一共 46.9 秒
a 205 megabyte download, then pip installs uv, all in 46.9 seconds.

164
00:10:03,367 --> 00:10:07,442
构建步骤 3 和 4 设置工作目录，复制我们的文件
Build steps 3 and 4 set the working folder and copy our files.

165
00:10:07,762 --> 00:10:12,546
构建步骤 5 用 image 自带的 Python 3.12 运行 uv sync
Build step 5 runs uv sync with the image's own Python 3.12,

166
00:10:12,546 --> 00:10:19,601
建好 venv，然后解析出 1 个包：就是项目本身，还没有任何依赖
creates the venv, and resolves 1 package: the project itself, with no dependencies yet.

167
00:10:19,850 --> 00:10:23,800
最后它给 image 命名，还有一条关于第 10 行的警告
It ends by naming the image, with a warning about line 10:

168
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:27,274
Docker 会标出任何名字听起来像密钥的变量
Docker flags any variable whose name sounds secret.

169
00:10:27,594 --> 00:10:31,818
它的值只是一个路径，所以无害，而且每次构建你都会看到它
The value is just a path, so it's harmless, and you'll see it every build.

170
00:10:32,067 --> 00:10:37,550
额外跑一下 docker images：在这台机器上是 1.35 GB
An extra check, docker images, says 1.35 gigabytes on this machine.

171
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:41,075
最大的一层就是那个 RUN，比其他层大得多
By far the biggest layer is that one RUN,

172
00:10:41,075 --> 00:10:45,374
842 MB 的编译器、ffmpeg 和它们的库
842 megabytes of compilers, ffmpeg and their libraries,

173
00:10:45,374 --> 00:10:47,875
复制进来的目录则小得很
while the copied folder is tiny.

174
00:10:48,117 --> 00:10:51,609
如果你跳过了 uv init，构建步骤 5 就会失败
And if you skipped uv init, build step 5 fails,

175
00:10:51,609 --> 00:10:54,730
因为没有 pyproject.toml 可以同步
because there's no pyproject.toml to sync.

176
00:10:54,967 --> 00:11:00,430
来想一想。你只改了 cli.py 里的组名，然后重新构建
Ponder this. You change only the group name in cli.py and build again:

177
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:03,351
五个构建步骤里，哪些会重新运行？
which of the five build steps run again?

178
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,821
构建步骤 4 和 5
Build steps 4 and 5.

179
00:11:14,141 --> 00:11:17,458
复制进来的目录变了，所以复制那一步要重新跑
The copied folder changed, so the copy runs again,

180
00:11:17,458 --> 00:11:19,581
它后面的每一步也一样
and so does every step after it.

181
00:11:19,901 --> 00:11:22,591
构建步骤 2 和 3 直接用缓存
Build steps 2 and 3 come from the cache,

182
00:11:22,591 --> 00:11:26,088
构建步骤 1 是你本地已经有的基础 image
and build step 1 is the base image you already have.

183
00:11:26,408 --> 00:11:28,008
第二部分我们会亲眼看到
We'll see it in part 2.

184
00:11:29,650 --> 00:11:32,743
第 6 步运行 image，所以先看一张图
Step 6 runs the image, so first, a picture.

185
00:11:33,063 --> 00:11:37,842
复制进来的文件在 /app 里；venv 在它外面，在 /home 里
The copied files sit in /app; the venv sits outside it, in /home.

186
00:11:38,162 --> 00:11:42,941
和第 2 讲一样，container 会在上面加一层薄薄的可写层
As in lecture 2, a container adds a thin writable layer,

187
00:11:42,941 --> 00:11:45,330
--rm 让它在退出时被扔掉
thrown away on exit by --rm.

188
00:11:45,567 --> 00:11:49,445
用 -v 把当前目录，也就是 pwd，挂载到 /app 上
-v mounts the current folder, pwd, onto /app:

189
00:11:49,445 --> 00:11:54,185
它盖住了复制进来的文件，所以 /app 现在就是你的目录
it covers the copied files, so /app is now your folder.

190
00:11:54,433 --> 00:11:57,612
所以你在 VS Code 里的修改，container 里马上就能看到
So edits in VS Code show up inside at once.

191
00:11:57,932 --> 00:11:59,622
写在 /app 下面的东西
Anything written under /app

192
00:11:59,622 --> 00:12:02,750
会直接写进你笔记本上的目录，而且留下来
goes straight into your laptop's folder and stays;

193
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:05,441
其他东西都落在用完就扔的那一层上
anything else lands on the throwaway layer.

194
00:12:05,683 --> 00:12:09,843
来想一想。在第 2 讲里，venv 就放在代码旁边
Ponder this. In lecture 2, the venv sat next to the code.

195
00:12:10,163 --> 00:12:11,663
如果这里它也放在 /app 里
If it sat in /app here,

196
00:12:11,663 --> 00:12:14,409
那 container 透过这个挂载会在那儿看到什么？
what would the container find there with this mount?

197
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:28,007
它会看到你笔记本上的目录，里面没有 venv，所以激活会失败
It would find your laptop's folder, with no venv in it, so activation would fail.

198
00:12:28,327 --> 00:12:32,082
第 9 行的 uv project environment 这个变量，防的就是这个
That's what line 9, UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT, prevents.

199
00:12:32,317 --> 00:12:34,692
输入 docker run，加上 --rm 和 -ti
Type docker run, --rm, -ti,

200
00:12:34,692 --> 00:12:38,034
带挂载的 -v，再加上 image 名
-v with the mount, and the image name.

201
00:12:38,354 --> 00:12:42,066
从 README 里复制，连引号一起，然后暂停，自己跑一遍
Copy it from the README, quotes included, and pause to run it.

202
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:45,944
在 Windows 上，这些命令要在 Git BASH 里跑
On Windows, run these commands in Git BASH,

203
00:12:45,944 --> 00:12:48,231
pwd 两边的引号要保留
keep the quotes around pwd,

204
00:12:48,231 --> 00:12:52,722
如果 docker run 报错：the input device is not a TTY
and if docker run says the input device is not a TTY,

205
00:12:52,722 --> 00:12:54,417
就在它前面加上 winpty
put winpty in front.

206
00:12:54,667 --> 00:12:56,063
提示符变了
The prompt changes:

207
00:12:56,063 --> 00:13:01,162
你是用户 app，在 /app 里，@ 符号后面是 container 的 ID
you're user app, in /app, and after the @ sign comes the container's ID,

208
00:13:01,162 --> 00:13:02,762
每次运行都不一样
new on every run.

209
00:13:02,850 --> 00:13:07,357
提示符里没有显示 venv 的名字，但 venv 其实已经激活了
No venv name shows in the prompt, yet the venv is active:

210
00:13:07,357 --> 00:13:11,469
两个额外检查显示 python 在 /home 下，版本 3.12
two extra checks find python in /home, version 3.12.

211
00:13:11,717 --> 00:13:15,775
再做两个额外检查：列出目录，是你笔记本上的文件
Two more extras: listing the folder shows your laptop's files,

212
00:13:15,775 --> 00:13:18,458
第 10 行那个指向密钥的变量也设好了
and the key variable from line 10 is set.

213
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:22,028
最后一个额外检查：让 cli.py 打印帮助
Last extra: ask cli.py for its help.

214
00:13:22,348 --> 00:13:23,848
报 ModuleNotFoundError
ModuleNotFoundError,

215
00:13:23,848 --> 00:13:27,831
No module named google：包还没装
No module named google: the packages aren't installed yet.

216
00:13:28,067 --> 00:13:30,491
这个 container 跑起来了，也看得到你的目录
The container runs and sees your folder,

217
00:13:30,491 --> 00:13:32,248
但 Python 找不到 Google
but Python can't find Google.

218
00:13:32,568 --> 00:13:35,453
如果你在这里停下，就重跑同一条 docker run
If you stop here, rerun the same docker run

219
00:13:35,453 --> 00:13:38,606
在 transcribe audio 目录里跑，再看第二部分
from the transcribe audio folder before part 2.

220
00:13:38,926 --> 00:13:42,872
第二部分，我们来加上这些包，并弄清楚它们为什么会消失
In part 2, we add the packages, and find out why they vanish.

221
00:13:44,517 --> 00:13:45,832
欢迎回来
Welcome back.

222
00:13:45,882 --> 00:13:48,645
我们在 transcribe audio 这个 container 里
We're inside the transcribe audio container,

223
00:13:48,645 --> 00:13:51,408
Python 还找不到 Google 的包
and Python can't find Google's packages yet.

224
00:13:51,650 --> 00:13:55,118
第 7 步：README 列出了三个要加的包
Step 7: the README lists three packages to add,

225
00:13:55,118 --> 00:13:58,071
所以用一条 uv add 命令把三个一起加上
so type all three in one uv add command.

226
00:13:58,391 --> 00:13:59,991
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

227
00:14:01,684 --> 00:14:04,863
要了 3 个包，装了 26 个
Three packages asked for, and 26 installed.

228
00:14:05,183 --> 00:14:09,311
和第 1 讲一样，每个包都会带来自己的依赖
As in lecture 1, each package brings its own dependencies,

229
00:14:09,311 --> 00:14:11,518
uv 会解析整棵依赖树
and uv resolves the whole tree.

230
00:14:11,767 --> 00:14:13,388
那这些东西都去了哪儿？
But where did everything land?

231
00:14:13,708 --> 00:14:18,738
清单 pyproject.toml 和小票 uv.lock 都在 /app 里
The list, pyproject.toml, and the receipt, uv.lock, sit in /app,

232
00:14:18,738 --> 00:14:21,410
所以它们直接写进了你的笔记本
so they're written to your laptop.

233
00:14:21,730 --> 00:14:24,843
而那 26 个包进了 /home 下的 venv
The 26 packages went into the venv in /home,

234
00:14:24,843 --> 00:14:27,319
落在 container 那层用完就扔的可写层上
on the container's throwaway layer.

235
00:14:27,567 --> 00:14:29,160
两个额外检查
Two extra checks.

236
00:14:29,210 --> 00:14:33,462
这个 pyproject.toml 现在列出了这三个包
The pyproject.toml now lists the three packages,

237
00:14:33,462 --> 00:14:35,588
每个都带版本下限
each with a lower bound,

238
00:14:35,588 --> 00:14:40,991
cli.py 旁边多了一个约 138 KB 的新 uv.lock
and a new uv.lock of about 138 kilobytes sits next to cli.py,

239
00:14:40,991 --> 00:14:42,591
所有者是用户 app
owned by user app.

240
00:14:42,834 --> 00:14:49,298
再加一个额外检查：venv 变量是 /home/app/.venv，在窗外
Another extra: the venv variable says /home/app/.venv, outside the window.

241
00:14:49,534 --> 00:14:50,913
补充两句
Two asides.

242
00:14:50,963 --> 00:14:56,361
这个包叫 ffmpeg-python；单单一个 ffmpeg 是另一个项目
The package is ffmpeg-python; plain ffmpeg is another project.

243
00:14:56,681 --> 00:14:58,442
还有，如果你用的是 Linux 笔记本
And on a Linux laptop

244
00:14:58,442 --> 00:15:04,383
目录又不属于用户 ID 1000，uv add 会报 permission denied
whose folder isn't owned by user ID 1000, uv add fails with permission denied:

245
00:15:04,383 --> 00:15:07,262
屏幕上的 chown 命令能修好它
the chown command on screen fixes it.

246
00:15:09,217 --> 00:15:12,332
README 里还说：退出以后，要重新构建 image
The README adds: when you exit, rebuild the image.

247
00:15:12,652 --> 00:15:14,985
我们最后再做这一步，到时候就知道为什么了
We'll do that at the end, and see why.

248
00:15:15,035 --> 00:15:16,869
第 8 步：设置你的组名
Step 8: set your group name.

249
00:15:17,189 --> 00:15:20,841
在你的笔记本上，用 VS Code 打开 cli.py
On your laptop, in VS Code, open cli.py

250
00:15:20,841 --> 00:15:24,493
把第 21 行改成你们组的名字
and change line 21 to your team's name;

251
00:15:24,493 --> 00:15:26,093
我们的是 group-01
ours is group-01.

252
00:15:26,405 --> 00:15:28,005
暂停一下，把它改好
Pause and make the change.

253
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:31,390
在 container 里，额外的 grep 已经显示出新的那一行
Inside, an extra grep already shows the new line:

254
00:15:31,390 --> 00:15:33,149
这扇窗两边都是通的
the window works both ways.

255
00:15:33,469 --> 00:15:36,754
五个 cli.py 文件里都要用同一个名字
Use the same name in all five cli.py files,

256
00:15:36,754 --> 00:15:40,040
不然各个阶段就找不到彼此的成果
or the stages won't find each other's work.

257
00:15:40,284 --> 00:15:43,932
第 9 步：python cli.py --help
Step 9: python cli.py --help.

258
00:15:44,252 --> 00:15:48,071
这次成功了，而且和 README 里那段逐行一致
This time it works, and it matches the README's block line for line.

259
00:15:48,391 --> 00:15:50,118
暂停一下，跟到这一步
Pause, and get to this point.

260
00:15:51,967 --> 00:15:59,348
第 10 步下载录音：python cli.py --download，简写是 -d
Step 10 downloads the recordings: python cli.py --download, or -d for short.

261
00:15:59,668 --> 00:16:03,359
我们录制的机器上没有密钥，所以这里看到的是缺密钥时的样子
Our machine had no key, so here's what a missing key looks like.

262
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:07,291
它先打印出参数和 download 这个词，然后是一段 traceback
It printed the arguments and the word download, then a traceback.

263
00:16:07,611 --> 00:16:11,250
最后一行是 DefaultCredentialsError
The last line says DefaultCredentialsError:

264
00:16:11,250 --> 00:16:15,483
找不到 secrets/mega-pipeline.json 这个文件
the file secrets/mega-pipeline.json was not found.

265
00:16:15,717 --> 00:16:17,445
按第 1 讲的方法来读
Read it as in lecture 1.

266
00:16:17,765 --> 00:16:20,858
我们的代码在第 36 行创建了一个 storage 客户端
Our code, line 36, built a storage client.

267
00:16:21,178 --> 00:16:24,530
客户端向 Google 的认证库要凭据
The client asked Google's auth library for credentials,

268
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:27,152
认证库就去找一个不存在的文件
and that library looked for a missing file.

269
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:29,064
正常情况下，链条是这样的
Here's the chain when it works.

270
00:16:29,384 --> 00:16:34,504
你的代码从来不传密钥：客户端会去问 Google 的认证库“我是谁”
Your code never passes the key: the client asks Google's auth library who it is.

271
00:16:34,824 --> 00:16:39,273
这个查找过程叫应用默认凭据，简称 ADC
That search is called application default credentials, or ADC,

272
00:16:39,273 --> 00:16:42,718
它的第一站就是第 10 行的那个变量
and its first stop is the variable from line 10.

273
00:16:42,967 --> 00:16:45,368
这个变量就是一个路标
That variable is a signpost:

274
00:16:45,368 --> 00:16:51,116
secrets/mega-pipeline.json，从当前目录 /app 算起
secrets/mega-pipeline.json, starting from the current folder, /app.

275
00:16:51,436 --> 00:16:54,444
透过这扇窗，它指向你笔记本上的密钥
Through the window, it leads to the key on your laptop.

276
00:16:54,834 --> 00:16:58,558
认证库用密钥生成一个短期有效的访问令牌
From the key, the library makes a short-lived access token,

277
00:16:58,558 --> 00:17:01,020
每个发给 Google 的请求都带着它
and every request to Google carries it.

278
00:17:01,267 --> 00:17:04,104
接着 Google 会检查两次，README 里也这么说
Google then checks twice, as the README says.

279
00:17:04,424 --> 00:17:10,317
身份验证问的是谁在调用，密钥说是课程的服务账号
Authentication asks who is calling, and the key says it's the course's service account;

280
00:17:10,317 --> 00:17:15,262
授权问的是它有没有权限做这件事，IAM 角色为它打开了 bucket
authorization asks whether it may do this, and IAM roles open the bucket.

281
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:17,676
这个报错通常有三个原因
This error has three usual causes.

282
00:17:17,996 --> 00:17:21,261
要么密钥不在这个组件的 secrets 目录里
The key isn't in this component's secrets folder,

283
00:17:21,261 --> 00:17:23,728
要么你 cd 离开了 /app
you changed directory away from /app,

284
00:17:23,728 --> 00:17:27,127
要么你在笔记本上错误的目录里跑了 docker run
or you ran docker run from the wrong laptop folder.

285
00:17:31,067 --> 00:17:33,629
一个额外检查：就连这次失败的运行
One extra check: even this failed run

286
00:17:33,629 --> 00:17:37,022
也在你笔记本上建了两个目录，input audios
created two folders on your laptop, input audios,

287
00:17:37,022 --> 00:17:39,792
还有里面带着你们组目录的 text prompts
and text prompts with your group inside.

288
00:17:40,112 --> 00:17:42,736
代码是在创建客户端之前建好它们的
The code makes them before it builds the client.

289
00:17:43,784 --> 00:17:48,630
有密钥的话，要找的是 download 这个词、每段录音一个对象名
With your key, look for the word download, one object name per recording,

290
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:52,680
还有出现在你笔记本上 input audios 里的音频文件
and the audio files appearing in input audios on your laptop.

291
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,837
暂停一下，确认密钥在 secrets 目录里，然后跑一遍
Pause, check your key is in secrets, and run it.

292
