An optional bonus in E speaks the French with ElevenLabs, in the instructor's voice.

442
00:26:42,314 --> 00:26:45,613
用 ElevenLabs 以授课老师的声音念出法语
An optional bonus in E speaks the French with ElevenLabs, in the instructor's voice.

443
00:26:45,933 --> 00:26:48,973
它用的是你自己的 ElevenLabs 密钥和配额
It uses your own ElevenLabs key and quota:

444
00:26:48,973 --> 00:26:50,565
secrets 里放一个密钥文件
a key file in secrets,

445
00:26:50,565 --> 00:26:54,979
附加脚本里也要填上你的组名，还要 uv add requests
your group name in the bonus script too, and uv add requests.

446
00:26:55,216 --> 00:26:56,837
然后跑它的三条命令
Then run its three commands.

447
00:26:57,157 --> 00:27:02,747
没有密钥文件的话，连下载都会失败：脚本一启动就会读那个文件
Without the key file, even download fails: the script reads that file as soon as it starts.

448
00:27:02,983 --> 00:27:04,967
暂停一下，退出，然后重新构建 E
Pause to exit and rebuild E.

449
00:27:05,287 --> 00:27:07,977
五个都做完以后，你们组的抽屉一个个填满
With all five done, your group's drawers fill,

450
00:27:07,977 --> 00:27:10,023
排行榜上你那一行也会亮起来
and your leaderboard row lights up.

451
00:27:12,167 --> 00:27:14,130
关于密钥，最后一个问题
One last question about the key.

452
00:27:14,450 --> 00:27:17,202
它被 Git 忽略了，所以永远不会传到 GitHub
It's git-ignored, so it never reaches GitHub.

453
00:27:17,522 --> 00:27:20,596
可是你构建了 image，还把它 push 到了 Docker Hub
But you build the image and push it to Docker Hub:

454
00:27:20,596 --> 00:27:22,196
密钥在不在里面？
is the key inside?

455
00:27:30,550 --> 00:27:34,177
我们来验证一下，用一个 82 字节的替身文件代替真正的密钥
Let's test it, with an 82 byte stand-in for the real key.

456
00:27:34,497 --> 00:27:39,276
这几条额外的 Git 命令显示，它被 .gitignore 的第 3 行忽略了
These extra Git commands show it's ignored, by line 3 of .gitignore.

457
00:27:41,050 --> 00:27:46,213
现在重新构建，再列出 image 本身里面的 secrets 目录，不挂载
Now rebuild, and list the secrets folder inside the image itself, with no mount.

458
00:27:46,533 --> 00:27:50,607
就在这儿：mega-pipeline.json，在 image 里面
There it is: mega-pipeline.json, inside the image.

459
00:27:50,927 --> 00:27:54,136
你真正的密钥就在你今天构建的每个 image 里
Your real key is in every image you built today,

460
00:27:54,136 --> 00:27:56,410
因为第 2 步在第 5 步之前
because step 2 came before step 5.

461
00:27:56,650 --> 00:27:58,783
Docker 不读 .gitignore
Docker doesn't read .gitignore.

462
00:27:59,103 --> 00:28:03,672
还记得第 2 讲的包裹吗：构建上下文就是整个目录
Remember lecture 2's parcel: the build context is the whole folder,

463
00:28:03,672 --> 00:28:07,082
密钥也在里面，COPY 那一行会把它全部拆开放进去
key included, and the copy line unpacks all of it.

464
00:28:07,402 --> 00:28:10,005
README 里关于 secrets 的提示只管 Git
The README's secrets note only covers Git.

465
00:28:10,250 --> 00:28:14,537
解决办法第 2 讲也推荐过，在这里算额外步骤
The fix, which lecture 2 recommended, is an extra here:

466
00:28:14,537 --> 00:28:18,591
一个叫 .dockerignore 的文件，只有一行：secrets/
a file named .dockerignore, with one line, secrets/.

467
00:28:18,911 --> 00:28:23,733
五个 image 都复制了密钥，所以暂停一下，在五个目录里都加上它
All five images copied the key, so pause and add it in all five folders.

468
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,917
重新构建，再列一次
Rebuild, and list again:

469
00:28:26,917 --> 00:28:29,851
报 cannot access，No such file or directory
cannot access, No such file or directory.

470
00:28:30,171 --> 00:28:31,878
密钥没有进 image
The key stayed out of the image.

471
00:28:32,567 --> 00:28:33,925
而运行照样没问题
And the run still works,

472
00:28:33,925 --> 00:28:38,114
因为挂载会在 container 启动时把你的 secrets 目录带进来
because the mount brings your secrets folder in when the container starts.

473
00:28:38,350 --> 00:28:42,909
README 最后那个可选部分，是把 image push 到 Docker Hub
The README's optional last section pushes the image to Docker Hub:

474
00:28:42,909 --> 00:28:46,777
先在那里创建一个访问令牌，然后登录、打 tag、push
create an access token there, then log in, tag and push.

475
00:28:47,097 --> 00:28:50,510
只 push 用那个 .dockerignore 构建出来的 image
Only push an image built with that .dockerignore.

476
00:28:50,750 --> 00:28:55,186
登录时只给用户名，等它提示输入时再粘贴访问令牌
Log in with just your user name and paste the token at the prompt;

477
00:28:55,186 --> 00:28:57,875
令牌写在 -p 后面就会留在你的 shell 历史记录里
after -p it stays in your shell history.

478
00:28:58,195 --> 00:29:02,142
如果你曾经 push 过带密钥的 image，把它删掉，并告诉课程团队
If you ever pushed an image with the key, delete it and tell the staff.

479
00:29:02,384 --> 00:29:04,222
课程接下来的方向
Where the course is heading:

480
00:29:04,222 --> 00:29:08,228
去年的参考答案把 secrets 目录放在 repo 外面
last year's solution kept the secrets folder outside the repo

481
00:29:08,228 --> 00:29:10,789
运行时再把它挂载到 /secrets
and mounted it at /secrets at run time.

482
00:29:11,109 --> 00:29:13,157
密钥从来不会进入 image
No key ever enters the image.

483
00:29:14,500 --> 00:29:16,007
该清理了
Time to clean up.

484
00:29:16,057 --> 00:29:21,071
云上没有要删的东西：你没有创建任何机器、bucket 或账号
In the cloud there's nothing to delete: you created no machine, bucket or account.

485
00:29:21,317 --> 00:29:24,325
在本地，用 cd .. 回到 repo 的根目录
Locally, cd .. back up to the repo.

486
00:29:24,645 --> 00:29:28,079
一条额外的命令列出这五个 image
An extra command lists the five images:

487
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:35,034
transcribe audio 是 1.48 GB，其他四个各约 845 MB
transcribe audio at 1.48 gigabytes, the other four at about 845 megabytes each.

488
00:29:35,283 --> 00:29:37,083
想保住你的成果，就检查一下 Git
To keep your work, check Git.

489
00:29:37,331 --> 00:29:38,831
额外跑一下 git status
An extra git status

490
00:29:38,831 --> 00:29:43,420
它显示你改过的 cli.py 和 generate text 里的文件
shows your edited cli.py files and the files in generate text,

491
00:29:43,420 --> 00:29:48,531
但另外四个目录藏起了它们的 Dockerfile 和项目文件
but the other four folders hide their Dockerfiles and project files.

492
00:29:48,767 --> 00:29:50,209
在你自己的 repo 里
In your own repo,

493
00:29:50,209 --> 00:29:54,117
用 git add -f 把这些 Dockerfile 和项目文件加进去
add those Dockerfiles and project files with git add -f,

494
00:29:54,117 --> 00:29:58,367
但别加数据目录，secrets 则要一直忽略下去
but not the data folders, and never stop ignoring secrets.

495
00:29:58,617 --> 00:30:02,650
然后暂停，用 docker image rm 删掉这五个 image
Then pause and remove the five images with docker image rm,

496
00:30:02,650 --> 00:30:04,114
这也是额外步骤
another extra.

497
00:30:04,164 --> 00:30:07,999
旧的构建会留下来，没有 tag，每个都带着你的密钥
Older builds stay behind untagged, each holding your key,

498
00:30:07,999 --> 00:30:10,691
所以再用 docker image prune 把它们也删掉
so docker image prune removes those too.

499
00:30:13,717 --> 00:30:15,722
五道自测题
Five questions to test yourself.

500
00:30:16,042 --> 00:30:20,053
第一题：D，也就是 translate text，读哪个抽屉，又是谁写的？
One: which drawer does D, translate text, read, and who wrote it?

501
00:30:20,373 --> 00:30:23,085
第二题：为什么挂载没有盖住那些包
Two: why doesn't the mount hide the packages,

502
00:30:23,085 --> 00:30:26,218
没有 uv project environment 这个变量，又会出什么问题？
and what breaks without UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT?

503
00:30:26,467 --> 00:30:29,489
第三题：在用完就扔的 container 里 uv add 之后
Three: after uv add in a throwaway container,

504
00:30:29,489 --> 00:30:32,376
什么会留下来，又是什么让它永久保留？
what survives, and what makes it permanent?

505
00:30:32,696 --> 00:30:37,091
第四题：哪个变量指向密钥，为什么只有在 /app 里才管用？
Four: which variable points to the key, and why only from /app?

506
00:30:37,411 --> 00:30:41,101
第五题：被 Git 忽略的密钥怎么会进 image，怎么修？
Five: how can an image hold a git-ignored key, and the fix?

507
00:30:41,350 --> 00:30:45,787
答案在练习里；每条命令都在学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises; every command is in the study guide.

508
00:30:46,107 --> 00:30:50,932
下节课：你自己的 bucket 和服务账号，放在 repo 外面的密钥
Next lecture: your own bucket and service account, the key outside the repo,

509
00:30:50,932 --> 00:30:54,043
还有一个帮你构建并运行每个 container 的脚本
and a script that builds and runs each container.
